  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Administrative support for tendering flood works</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The scope of this assignment is to support the relevant departments of Malolos, such as engineering, legal, financial and procurement, in their effort to prepare the budgetary approval and tendering of newly designed Malolos flood works. The goal is to provide input and work with the local staff to make sure the right ingredients are in the documents for a qualitatively good result of a future tendering process. Ultimately, the goal is that the city is able to select a suitable contractor for implementation of the flood works, and knows which aspects are important in these types of projects.</narrative>
  </description>
